here that I also need to do, right? That my life also is not going the way that it feels like it should be going. Even though everything's going perfectly well, there's something missing. I also need to take the leap that Dean Karnazes took. I understand that his longest race ever was 350 miles and to complete it he ran continuously for three days and nights without sleep. That's insane Jessica. It is insane. I agree. I don't know honestly I don't know how he does it. He tells funny stories about calling on his cell phone to order a pizza delivery and he tells the pizza delivery guy, I will be at a particular location in an hour,

