bring me the pizza. And the guy brings him the pizza literally on the road in the middle of the night. He then proceeds to eat it right out of the box, holding the box in one hand, grabbing slices with another, while running the whole time. ["The Trial of the Heart"] So Dean says that when people hear his story, they often have a couple of questions. What are these questions?

