in almost every individual's life, there's a choice, right? You can kind of do the minimal, make enough money to support yourself, and then sit on the couch and watch TV, or you can do more. And pretty much all of us want to do more. And maybe we don't want to do more at our job. Maybe the job is just the thing that pays the bills.

30
00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:38.000
And our art is the place where we feel good about ourselves. And that's where we put in more. Maybe our family or raising a child or being a good partner. There's lots of different ways that pride can express itself and that we can find our way of fulfilling these needs that we have to be a good person. But everyone has that need. ["Pride is the Most Important Thing in Our Lives"]

