felt really good about myself. All that hard work had paid off. That's classic authentic pride. I mean, that is really that's exactly what it is. You work hard, you get the achievement and the achievement makes you feel pride in such a way that you're very focused on the effort that you put in, which again is reinforcing of that effort. The motivation then is there to put that effort in again in the future.

