do I continue it? And one easy way that we've all learned is tell someone else because they're gonna congratulate you, they're gonna tell you how awesome you are, that's gonna maximize and lengthen and extend those feelings. The problem is, depending on who you are, that's going to maximize and lengthen and extend those feelings. The problem is, depending on who you tell, depending on how many people you tell, and depending on how you tell it, that's where it can risk sliding into hubristic pride. I understand that you and others have examined whether there are personality differences associated with these two kinds of pride.

